WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.952
Mom opened the car door.

2
00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:24.676
"Cassie, meet Max.

3
00:00:24.677 --> 00:00:27.227
He's our new pet."

4
00:00:27.228 --> 00:00:32.109
Cassie grinned as a black dog ran toward her.

5
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.863
The dog wagged his tail and licked her face.

6
00:00:35.864 --> 00:00:40.245
Then he jumped into her lap.

7
00:00:40.246 --> 00:00:43.550
"He likes you," Mom said.

8
00:00:43.551 --> 00:00:46.690
"I like him too," Cassie said.

9
00:00:46.691 --> 00:00:51.869
"I'm going to take him everywhere!"

10
00:00:51.870 --> 00:01:03.870
The next day Mom and Cassie took Max downtown.

11
00:01:03.871 --> 00:01:09.286
They went to the library first.

12
00:01:09.287 --> 00:01:13.633
"I'm sorry," the librarian said.

13
00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:23.022
"No dogs are allowed in the library."

14
00:01:23.023 --> 00:01:32.204
Next they went to the pharmacy.

15
00:01:32.205 --> 00:01:37.944
"Ugh." Cassie groaned when she saw the sign on the window.

16
00:01:37.945 --> 00:01:44.740
"No Dogs Allowed."

17
00:01:44.741 --> 00:01:55.196
After the pharmacy, they walked to the butcher shop.

18
00:01:55.197 --> 00:01:57.956
The butcher glared at them.

19
00:01:57.957 --> 00:02:08.296
"No dogs are allowed!" he said.

20
00:02:08.297 --> 00:02:13.632
While Mom bought some meat for dinner, Cassie waited outside.

21
00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:18.834
"I wanted to take you everywhere, Max," she said sadly.

22
00:02:18.835 --> 00:02:26.067
"But everyone says, 'No dogs are allowed!'"

23
00:02:26.068 --> 00:02:31.495
Max looked up and licked her face.

24
00:02:31.496 --> 00:02:44.533
"Let's walk home through the park," Mom said.

25
00:02:44.534 --> 00:02:51.649
Suddenly Max sniffed the air.

26
00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:55.997
"I think he wants us to follow him," Cassie said.

27
00:02:55.998 --> 00:02:59.336
Max ran through the park.

28
00:02:59.337 --> 00:03:05.663
Cassie heard loud barking.

29
00:03:05.664 --> 00:03:16.729
Then Max stopped near a tall fence.

30
00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.244
Cassie read the sign on the gate:

31
00:03:19.245 --> 00:03:22.584
Friendly Dogs Welcome.

32
00:03:22.585 --> 00:03:28.103
"Yay! It's a dog park!" she cried.

33
00:03:28.104 --> 00:03:31.234
"Dogs are welcome here!"

34
00:03:31.235 --> 00:03:34.703
She bent down to hug her new pet.

35
00:03:34.704 --> 00:03:38.289
"I guess I can't take you everywhere, Max.

36
00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.543
But we can always come here together!"

37
00:03:41.544 --> 00:03:45.944
"Woof!" Max barked happily.

